James,

For mailbox commands which the firmware internally times-out in 
2 * R_A_TOV, the driver should timeout no sooner than 2.5 * R_A_TOV so
we do not inappropriately schedule an ISP abort.

Please apply.

Regards,
Andrew Vasquez

--=-OtSpx/rKVc7utHHutYcR
